{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Winter Seeds are a type of ",["l","打造","Crafted"]," seed. The crafting recipe is labeled \"Wild Seeds (Wi)\", but when crafted, the result is \"Winter Seeds.\" Mature plants yield, at random, a ",["l","番红花","Crocus"],", ",["l","水晶果","Crystal Fruit"],", ",["l","雪山药","Snow Yam"],", or ",["l","冬根","Winter Root"],"."]],["p",["Winter Seeds are one of the season-specific crafted wild seeds, along with ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"],", ",["l","夏季种子","Summer Seeds"],", and ",["l","秋季种子","Fall Seeds"]," that produce crops normally found as ",["l","采集","forage"],". While Farming Skill normally increases the chance to grow a quality crop, Foraging Skill increases the chance to grow a quality crop from Winter Seeds. Choosing the ",["l","技能","Botanist profession"]," will ensure iridium-quality crops grown from Winter Seeds."]],["p",["Crows do not attack crops grown from Winter Seeds, so the use of ",["l","稻草人","Scarecrow"],"s is unnecessary."]]]],["Sources",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","打造","Crafting"]," (each recipe produces 10 Winter Seeds)"]],[1,["Placing a ",["l","冬根","Winter Root"]," in a ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"]," (yield: 1-3 Winter Seeds)"]],[1,["Completing the Crafts Room (reward: 30 Winter Seeds)"]],[1,[["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," (price 100–1,000g)"]],[1,[["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," on ",["l","周循环","Saturdays"]," in exchange for 2 ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"]]],[1,[["l","骷髅洞穴","Treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern (5-20 each)"]],[1,[["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival: 50% chance to obtain 10 Winter Seeds as a silver tier reward on the 12th, and 50% chance to obtain 15 Winter Seeds as a silver tier reward on the 13th"]]]]]],["Crops Harvested",2,[["p",["Each Winter Seed has an equal chance of yielding one of any of the items shown below."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Source"]}],[[["i","(O)418","Crocus"]],["A flower that can bloom in the winter."],[["l","采集","Winter Foraging"]," • Winter Seeds"]],[[["i","